 class=\"fontstyle0\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.lgo65vICBaqKZWjM]{Inner Instincts}, Journey Feature</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+4</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.gWNw1LL4Y6x5OYgF]{Ability Score Improvement}</td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+5</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.CAOKS5xYK2tMgc55]{Without Trace}</td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+5</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.orXjmuTlAUrZCLuO]{Unshakable}</td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+5</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Journey Feature</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">16</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+5</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.gWNw1LL4Y6x5OYgF]{Ability Score Improvement}</td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">17</td><td style=\"width:7.63901%;height:16px;text-align:center\">+6</td><td style=\"width:33.9119%;height:16px;text-align:center\">@Compendium[world.profession-features.QE2JdM5vvQDBOPXg]{One with the Environment}</td></tr><tr style=\"height:16px\"><td style=\"width:4.4985%;height:16px;text-align:center\">1